Fleet Service Alembic commands

Run commands from the fleet-service directory:

  python -m alembic -c alembic/alembic.ini current
  python -m alembic -c alembic/alembic.ini revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
  python -m alembic -c alembic/alembic.ini upgrade head

The database URL is read from this service's .env through app.core.config.
Review every generated revision before applying it.
The first revision creates tables and is intended for a new empty database.
